 "id": "lem-zl-noether-normalization-field",
 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Noether normalization over a field",
 "statement": "Let $K$ be a field and $B\\neq0$ a finitely generated commutative\n$K$-algebra. There exist an integer $d\\geq0$ and an injective\n$K$-algebra homomorphism $K[T_1,\\ldots,T_d]\\to B$ over which\n$B$ is a finitely generated module.\nThe reference formulation is\n[Stacks Project,\nLemma 10.115.4](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/00OY).",
